<title>THAILAND: Italian-Thai Development Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Italian-Thai Development Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first nine months ending Septemer 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 1.27     vs	     1.00</p>
<p>    Net			317.21     vs	   248.83</p>
<p>					   Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.74     vs	     4.43</p>
<p>    Net		    1,185.02     vs	 1,106.47</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Italian-Thai Development Plc, a construction firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
